<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS2" title="In Appendix C Detailed Derivations of Density Operators in the Continuum Limit ‣ Lost in the Middle at Birth: An Exact Theory of Transformer Position Bias" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.2 </span>Influence Density for the Causal Residual Kernel</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
